# Checkouts bin/sync fast-forwards onto origin/main.
# One line per repository, slug and absolute host path, no quotes:
#
#   owner/repo=/home/you/projects/oss/checkout
#
# A checkout is updated only when it is clean, on main, and not mid-merge or
# mid-rebase. Anything else is skipped and reported. Keep this file out of git:
# copy it to sync.map, which holds your real paths.

# awf-project/cli=/home/you/projects/oss/cli
# vasilvestre/opencode-dots=/home/you/projects/perso/opencode-dots
